{"id":"20626","t":{"th":"ศึกจอมเวทอภินิหาร ซีซัน 2","ro":"FAIRY TAIL (2014)","en":"Fairy Tail Series 2","na":"FAIRY TAIL (2014)","thShared":true},"cover":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx20626-9LTreIofBgnu.jpg","coverM":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx20626-9LTreIofBgnu.jpg","color":"#febb28","banner":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20626-tVqtIqsuRhCJ.jpg","fmt":"TV","status":"FINISHED","eps":102,"dur":24,"season":"SPRING","year":2014,"start":"2014-04-05","country":"JP","genres":["Action","Adventure","Fantasy"],"score":74,"pop":188290,"studio":"A-1 Pictures, Bridge","desc":"The Grand Magic Games reaches its climax following Natsu Dragneel and Gajeel Redfox's stunning victory over Sting Eucliffe and Rogue Cheney of the Sabertooth guild. This success pushes the Fairy Tail guild closer to being crowned the overall champions, but obtaining victory isn't the only challenge they face. A mystery still surrounds a hooded stranger and the ominous Eclipse Gate, leaving more questions than answers.\n\nMore crazy adventures are on the horizon for Fairy Tail as their destructive antics and joyful rowdiness continue unabated. Their greatest trial is quickly approaching, but united as a family, the guild will always be ready to face any threat that comes their way.","descTh":"Grand Magic Games มาถึงจุดสูงสุดหลังจากชัยชนะอันน่าทึ่งของ Natsu Dragneel และ Gajeel Redfox เหนือ Sting Eucliffe และ Rogue Cheney แห่งกิลด์ Sabertooth ความสำเร็จนี้ผลักดันให้กิลด์แฟรี่เทลเข้าใกล้การครองตำแหน่งแชมป์เปี้ยนโดยรวมมากขึ้น แต่การได้รับชัยชนะไม่ใช่ความท้าทายเดียวที่พวกเขาเผชิญ ความลึกลับยังคงล้อมรอบคนแปลกหน้าที่สวมหน้ากากและ Eclipse Gate ที่เป็นลางไม่ดี ทิ้งคำถามไว้มากกว่าคำตอบ\n\nการผจญภัยที่บ้าคลั่งอีกมากมายกำลังรออยู่ข้างหน้าสำหรับ Fairy Tail ในขณะที่การแสดงตลกที่ทำลายล้างและความเกเรอันสนุกสนานของพวกเขายังคงไม่ลดน้อยลง การทดลองที่ยิ่งใหญ่ที่สุดของพวกเขากำลังใกล้เข้ามาอย่างรวดเร็ว แต่เมื่อรวมเป็นหนึ่งครอบครัว กิลด์ก็พร้อมเสมอที่จะเผชิญกับภัยคุกคามใด ๆ ที่เข้ามาขวางทางพวกเขา","src":{"meta":"anilist","th":null,"descTh":"gtranslate"},"trailer":"usaOd9A00U0","al":"https://anilist.co/anime/20626","mal":"https://myanimelist.net/anime/22043","jp":null,"sched":[],"prov":[{"p":"muse_th","r":"TH","u":"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLIa05JMgYhhZGXgk3ktJyYpaNM2TOECfz","lang":"sub","eps":[["21","y:d8MoD0KiLEk",1793876407,"x",null,"196",{"d":1486,"sk":[[11.9,100.4],[1348.6,1475.1]]}],["20","y:7mpdM9y3KsM",1793790010,"x",null,"195",{"d":1486,"sk":[[43.0,131.0],[1349.0,1475.1]]}],["18","y:ft_JDQGmTF4",1793617209,"x",null,"193",{"d":1486,"sk":[[35.0,123.0],[1347.0,1475.1]]}],["17","y:7NZ_9nSowP0",1793530808,"x",null,"192",{"d":1486,"sk":[[103.9,192.1],[1348.0,1475.1]]}],["16","y:7sGDp3QoRT8",1793444407,"x",null,"191",{"d":1486,"sk":[[60.0,148.4],[1348.7,1475.1]]}],["12","y:Fgarx-dELd4",1793098807,"x",null,"187",{"d":1486,"sk":[[45.5,127.0],[1350.0,1475.1]]}],["10","y:1ZtOdKHM7H0",1792926006,"x",null,"185",{"d":1486,"sk":[[74.5,156.5],[1348.5,1475.1]]}],["8","y:EwWJeEzNPPU",1792753206,"x",null,"183",{"d":1486,"sk":[[23.4,105.0],[1351.3,1475.1]]}],["7","y:ZGAvYcSIkWM",1792666807,"x",null,"182",{"d":1486,"sk":[[19.5,101.0],[1352.0,1475.1]]}],["6","y:KkEnkj9HWW4",1792580409,"x",null,"181",{"d":1486,"sk":[[37.5,119.2],[1345.3,1475.1]]}],["4","y:8992I_V2jBA",1792490876,"~",null,"179",{"d":1486,"sk":[[19.5,101.2],[1352.0,1475.1]]}],["3","y:Ev5HHU0hCSA",1792404476,"~",null,"178",{"d":1485,"sk":[[56.5,138.5],[1353.9,1475.1]]}],["2","y:IX-yPlts_W4",1792318076,"~",null,"177",{"d":1486,"sk":[[42.4,124.0],[1354.0,1475.1]]}],["1","y:BA9uxv4Wwa0",1792231676,"~",null,"176",{"d":1486,"sk":[[56.4,138.5],[1354.3,1465.2]]}],["19","y:pzBdqrSKO4E",1767965441,"~",null,"194",{"d":1486,"sk":[[36.0,124.2],[1348.6,1475.1]]}],["15","y:uz3I5dJ253s",1767495835,"~",null,"190",{"d":1485,"sk":[[18.9,107.4],[1353.4,1475.1]]}],["5","y:tvH-tz55DVI",1767423085,"~",null,"180",{"d":1486,"sk":[[74.5,156.1],[1354.0,1